<title>USA: Applebee's International Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Applebee's International Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>OVERLAND PARK, Kan. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>13 Wks   14 Wks   52 Wks   53 Wks</p>
<p>				    Ended     Ended    Ended    Ended</p>
